VAR npcEmotion = "Angry"

Ah Mr Kim, You are finished, let me review your results. #speaker:Maggie
-> MissionBriefing

=== MissionBriefing ===  
Well done, Agent! You passed the test. Not bad at all. #speaker:Maggie  

But now, it’s time for real action. **Multiple false stories are spreading fast**, and fear is taking root. #speaker:Maggie  

Your job? **Talk to 10 people**. Find out what they’ve heard, spot the lies, and set the record straight. Use what you’ve learned. Keep the peace. If panic spreads too far, things could get *ugly*. #speaker:Maggie  

* Got it. Where do I start? #speaker:Player  
    First, you’ll need a **mission key**. Play the **media game** at the **arcade computer** to generate one. Once you have it, input the key into the **console** to begin. #speaker:Maggie  
    -> StartMission  

=== StartMission ===  
The city is counting on you. Stop the false stories before disaster strikes back. Good luck, Agent. #speaker:Maggie  
-> END
